{
  "id": "draft.dialogue.chiyoko.sweets",
  "kind": "dialogue",
  "title": "甜品店里有人在拍照",
  "status": "approved",
  "version": 1,
  "rootId": "draft.dialogue.chiyoko.sweets",
  "payload": {
    "id": "dialogue.chiyoko.sweets",
    "idolId": "chiyoko",
    "startNodeId": "01",
    "nodes": {
      "10": {
        "id": "10",
        "speakerId": "chiyoko",
        "text": "不、不是的！平时都有朋友一起，今天只是碰巧……！",
        "nextNodeId": "11"
      },
      "11": {
        "id": "11",
        "speakerId": "chiyoko",
        "text": "真、真是的！比起那个！制作人先生也来一个怎么样？",
        "nextNodeId": "12"
      },
      "12": {
        "id": "12",
        "speakerId": "chiyoko",
        "text": "偶然遇到好幸运，就当纪念！来，别客气！",
        "nextNodeId": "13"
      },
      "13": {
        "id": "13",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "诶？可以吗？",
        "nextNodeId": "14"
      },
      "14": {
        "id": "14",
        "speakerId": "chiyoko",
        "text": "是，当然！这个一定很好吃！",
        "nextNodeId": "15"
      },
      "15": {
        "id": "15",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "但这是智代子买的……",
        "nextNodeId": "16"
      },
      "16": {
        "id": "16",
        "speakerId": "chiyoko",
        "text": "好吃的东西，和别人分着吃会更美味的！",
        "nextNodeId": "17"
      },
      "17": {
        "id": "17",
        "speakerId": "chiyoko",
        "text": "对吧？所以制作人先生也别客气！",
        "nextNodeId": "18"
      },
      "18": {
        "id": "18",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "这样啊……那，我就拿一个吧。",
        "nextNodeId": "19"
      },
      "19": {
        "id": "19",
        "speakerId": "chiyoko",
        "text": "请！",
        "nextNodeId": "20"
      },
      "20": {
        "id": "20",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "……嗯！真的很好吃。不愧是到处吃的人。",
        "nextNodeId": "21"
      },
      "21": {
        "id": "21",
        "speakerId": "chiyoko",
        "text": "诶嘿嘿，太好了！谢谢！……啊，对了，得好好拍下来。",
        "nextNodeId": "22"
      },
      "22": {
        "id": "22",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "发社交平台用吗？",
        "nextNodeId": "23"
      },
      "23": {
        "id": "23",
        "speakerId": "chiyoko",
        "text": "是！不过，也有单纯想把好吃的东西记录下来的意思。",
        "nextNodeId": "24"
      },
      "24": {
        "id": "24",
        "speakerId": "chiyoko",
        "text": "……哇，这张拍得挺好！制作人先生也看看！",
        "nextNodeId": "25"
      },
      "25": {
        "id": "25",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "原来如此……拍得很好，感觉平时就拍惯了。",
        "nextNodeId": "26"
      },
      "26": {
        "id": "26",
        "speakerId": "chiyoko",
        "text": "诶嘿嘿，经常和朋友一起拍！",
        "nextNodeId": "27"
      },
      "27": {
        "id": "27",
        "speakerId": "chiyoko",
        "text": "大家都很厉害，所以我也研究了很多！角度之类的……",
        "nextNodeId": "28"
      },
      "28": {
        "id": "28",
        "speakerId": "chiyoko",
        "text": "因为有在等着看的人，所以想发一些让看的人也能笑一笑的东西。",
        "nextNodeId": "29"
      },
      "29": {
        "id": "29",
        "speakerId": "chiyoko",
        "text": "话说回来，好像还没和制作人先生拍过照呢？",
        "nextNodeId": "30"
      },
      "30": {
        "id": "30",
        "speakerId": "chiyoko",
        "text": "要不要一起拍一张？",
        "nextNodeId": "31"
      },
      "31": {
        "id": "31",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "诶，不，我就不用了。",
        "nextNodeId": "32"
      },
      "32": {
        "id": "32",
        "speakerId": "chiyoko",
        "text": "不用害羞！只要笑一下比个剪刀手就好！",
        "nextNodeId": "33"
      },
      "33": {
        "id": "33",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "不是那个问题……偶像和制作人的关系，这样不太好吧。",
        "nextNodeId": "34"
      },
      "34": {
        "id": "34",
        "speakerId": "chiyoko",
        "text": "是这样吗……？唔，可是……照片……",
        "nextNodeId": "35"
      },
      "35": {
        "id": "35",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "唔……",
        "nextNodeId": "36"
      },
      "36": {
        "id": "36",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "——对了。那，等『W.I.N.G.』夺冠，一起拍张纪念照怎么样？",
        "nextNodeId": "37"
      },
      "37": {
        "id": "37",
        "speakerId": "chiyoko",
        "text": "那真的可以吗！？",
        "nextNodeId": "38"
      },
      "38": {
        "id": "38",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "嗯，当然。",
        "nextNodeId": "39"
      },
      "39": {
        "id": "39",
        "speakerId": "chiyoko",
        "text": "哇，好棒啊！第一次的照片，是夺冠纪念！",
        "nextNodeId": "40"
      },
      "40": {
        "id": "40",
        "speakerId": "chiyoko",
        "text": "我更有干劲了！这个必须好好努力了！等着我哦，制作人先生！"
      },
      "01": {
        "id": "01",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "（……嗯？刚才那个声音，难道是……智代子？）",
        "nextNodeId": "02"
      },
      "02": {
        "id": "02",
        "speakerId": "chiyoko",
        "text": "嗯——！这个蛋糕，好好吃！这家店别的菜单也要检查一下……好！",
        "nextNodeId": "03"
      },
      "03": {
        "id": "03",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "啊，果然是智代子。",
        "nextNodeId": "04"
      },
      "04": {
        "id": "04",
        "speakerId": "chiyoko",
        "text": "咦，制作人先生！？好巧啊！",
        "nextNodeId": "05"
      },
      "05": {
        "id": "05",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "是啊，在这种地方遇到……智代子在做什么？",
        "nextNodeId": "06"
      },
      "06": {
        "id": "06",
        "speakerId": "chiyoko",
        "text": "我在甜品巡礼！休息日经常这样。",
        "nextNodeId": "07"
      },
      "07": {
        "id": "07",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "这样啊……不、不过，你点了不少啊……",
        "nextNodeId": "08"
      },
      "08": {
        "id": "08",
        "speakerId": "chiyoko",
        "text": "一个人独占这么多甜品……对我来说是最高级的奢侈！",
        "nextNodeId": "09"
      },
      "09": {
        "id": "09",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "这么多，都是一个人？",
        "nextNodeId": "10"
      }
    }
  },
  "annotations": [],
